<title>USA: W.W. Grainger, VWR in supply agreement.</title>
<headline>W.W. Grainger, VWR in supply agreement.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.W. Grainger Inc on Monday said it signed an agreement calling for VWR Scientific Products Corp to provide its products directly to customers of Grainger's Integrated Supply Organization.</p>
<p>The pact allows Grainger customers to buy VWR's maintenance, repair and operating products directly through the Grainger operation, thereby lowering materials and management costs, the company said.</p>
<p>A second agreement gives VWR customers similar access to Grainger products.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not annunced.</p>
<p>Grainger distributes maintenance, repair and operating supplies.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1-3/8 at 75-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
